cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ormas-monitor or its dead-channel certificate, please cite the paper below."
title: "ormas-monitor"
abstract: >-
  A PyTorch training-health library and CLI: per-layer alarms against each layer's own
  baseline, a certificate for dead Conv/Linear-BatchNorm-ReLU channels, optional repair,
  a weights-only checkpoint check, and a hash-chained, signable training record.
type: software
authors:
